        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/h/85f322/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-06-09T03:03:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hello all. Just wanted to ask if I am playing Matriarch the right way.</p>\n<p>Villain plays top card of villain deck.</p>\n<p>Its Kettle of Vultures. It does its 2 projectile damage then draw again.</p>\n<p>This time its Building of Rooks. It does its 2 projectile damage then draw again.</p>\n<p>Now do you just keep going through the rest of the deck or do you stop after the 1st draw?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:35:47.370Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
        "reads": 0,
